cff-version: 1.2.0
message: |
  If you use this work in a research paper, blog post, or product, please cite it
  as below. The BibTeX entry below is the canonical citation.
type: software
title: "Cheap Deterministic Shortcuts vs. LLM-as-a-Judge Metrics for RAG evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Agreement study between the four classic RAGAS LLM-judge metrics and cheap,
  deterministic shortcuts (embeddings, cross-encoders, NLI, ROUGE-L) on the
  session store of an agentic coding tool mirrored into a local vector database.
